{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-09-21 22:09:00', 'title': 'PNC BANK, N.A. CHANGES PRIME RATE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PNC BANK, N.A.'}{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-09-21 11:33:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES AUTHORITY BRANDS ON ITS PENDING SALE TO BRITISH COLUMBIA INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT CORPORATION AND FUNDS ADVISED BY APAX', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT IS ADVISING AUTHORITY BRANDS, A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF APAX PARTNERS LLP (APAX), ON ITS PENDING SALE TO BRITISH COLUMBIA INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT CORPORATION (BCI) ALONGSIDE FUNDS ADVISED BY APAX (APAX FUNDS), WHICH WILL RETAIN MAJORITY OWNERSHIP. AUTHORITY BRANDS IS THE PREMIER HOME SERVICE FRANCHISOR IN NORTH AMERICA. THE TRANSACTION IS BEING LED BY THE HARRIS WILLIAMS'}